  "foaf:name": "Blue Catalyst Fund",
  "sdo:name": "Blue Catalyst Fund",
  "sdo:description": "The Blue Catalyst Fund is a pioneering accelerator that de-risks, finances, and scales high-integrity blue carbon projects. It provides recoverable early-stage funding, repaid only after follow-on investment, plus technical expertise and transaction support to move projects from concept to investment while ensuring 100% project ownership. By addressing barriers such as limited expertise, high upfront costs, and financial structuring gaps, the Fund makes projects investment-ready. Its evergreen, revolving model establishes lasting market infrastructure for coastal restoration with climate, equity, and community impact at its core. Projects are chosen for both ecological value and their commitment to community participation, inclusion, and measurable social outcomes. Beyond carbon finance, the Fund supports diversified revenue streams—such as aquaculture, seaweed farming, and ecotourism—to deliver tangible benefits for communities and reduce dependence on external funding.",
